, who will be waiting for you just before each boss fight.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/b993260569c551d74e32bd3d817cf865.avif?t=1755109949\" width=\"616\"/></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"346\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/7b95d014dcf77f12a6805f4b47ab554f.poster.avif?t=1755109949\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/7b95d014dcf77f12a6805f4b47ab554f.webm?t=1755109949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/7b95d014dcf77f12a6805f4b47ab554f.mp4?t=1755109949\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/>Get your starting ticket from your adoptive mother Melinda and begin in the castle of your choice. Between levels, choose with the conductor Mak \u2014 from a random selection \u2014 which castle you want to advance to.<br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"48\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/3848af47150af6523d061657a065e752.avif?t=1755109949\" width=\"616\"/></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"148\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/0af9798672b9e235bf5666ddd25dd9ba.poster.avif?t=1755109949\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/0af9798672b9e235bf5666ddd25dd9ba.webm?t=1755109949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201780/extras/0af9798672b9e235bf5666ddd25dd9ba.mp4?